{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47021","headline":"湘妃庙 · 齐己","name":"湘妃庙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"湘烟蒙蒙湘水急，汀露凝红裛莲湿。\n苍梧云叠九嶷深，二女魂飞江上立。\n相携泣，凤盖龙舆追不及。\n庙荒松朽啼飞猩，笋鞭迸出阶基倾。\n黄昏一岸阴风起，新月如眉生阔水。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47021.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47021","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}